messages.content:
media queries help you apply different styles based on screen size or device type. like, you can have one layout for mobile and another for desktop. you can define them in your css like this:

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  /* styles for screens smaller than 600px */
}

@media (min-width: 601px) {
  /* styles for screens larger than 600px */
}

so you can adjust the layout based on the screen size. does that help?
